# Gradle APK builds

Do not run `gradlew`, `assembleDebug`, `assembleRelease`, or any Android APK/AAB build as part of ordinary implementation, verification, or "next step" work.

Only build the APK when the user explicitly asks (for example: "build the apk", "assemble debug", "gradle").
